{"3632670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mechaconda", "steam_appid": 3632670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive hordes of monsters and bosses</strong> while collecting cards that add unique ability upgrades to the body of a small snake, <strong>Mechaconda</strong>. A reimagining of the classic Snake game with modern gameplay and intense bullet hell action. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all bosses created by Dr. EVIL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/5295d7fb1abcae4965ef459d627e976f.poster.avif?t=1785422501\" width=800 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/5295d7fb1abcae4965ef459d627e976f.webm?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/5295d7fb1abcae4965ef459d627e976f.mp4?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/52478695f1139a357d7103bbbc68d7bf.poster.avif?t=1785422501\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/52478695f1139a357d7103bbbc68d7bf.webm?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/52478695f1139a357d7103bbbc68d7bf.mp4?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL THE LEVEL HORDES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, become stronger, and destroy all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/a188c075b75de15c2fdb5e67bcd6b005.poster.avif?t=1785422501\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/a188c075b75de15c2fdb5e67bcd6b005.webm?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/a188c075b75de15c2fdb5e67bcd6b005.mp4?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Mechaconda during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/6e6abd52796bdbe37cb70a3a260ed7c5.poster.avif?t=1785422501\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/6e6abd52796bdbe37cb70a3a260ed7c5.webm?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632670/extras/6e6abd52796bdbe37cb70a3a260ed7c5.mp4?t=1785422501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes: Campaign, Roguelike and Boss Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive hordes of monsters and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match upgrades for unique playstyles in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 cards with unique body abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragr